[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3818450517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115496#issuecomment-3818450517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115496","id":3818450517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jmO5V","user":{"login":"Coadon","id":50821025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODIxMDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50821025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon","html_url":"https://github.com/Coadon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Coadon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-29T15:35:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T15:35:16Z","body":"Same issue for Godot 4.6 on Mac too.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3818450517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825351844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115496#issuecomment-3825351844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115496","id":3825351844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kAjyk","user":{"login":"LuciCrack","id":120284270,"node_id":"U_kgDOBytkbg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120284270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack","html_url":"https://github.com/LuciCrack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuciCrack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T19:27:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T19:27:10Z","body":"I think I got a fix!\n\nIn my case I was using a script with cargo-make:\n\n```\n[tasks.debug]\nscript = [\n    \"cargo build\",\n    \"cp target/debug/libLosSementales.so ../godot/bin/libLosSementales.so\"\n]\n```\n\nbut using `cp` tries to **overwrite the existing file** in _godot/bin/_ which is where the extension is configured.\n\nso I tried using an alternative that **doesn't overwrite** but instead **create** a new file.\n\n```\n[tasks.debug]\nscript = [\n    \"cargo build\",\n    \"mv target/debug/libLosSementales.so ../godot/bin/libLosSementales.so\"\n]\n```\n\nand so far so good :D","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825351844/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963760873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115496#issuecomment-3963760873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115496","id":3963760873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7sQjDp","user":{"login":"BashirAbu","id":80569644,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTY5NjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80569644?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu","html_url":"https://github.com/BashirAbu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BashirAbu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-26T03:35:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T03:36:06Z","body":"> I think I got a fix!\n> \n> In my case I was using a script with cargo-make:\n> \n> ```\n> [tasks.debug]\n> script = [\n>     \"cargo build\",\n>     \"cp target/debug/libLosSementales.so ../godot/bin/libLosSementales.so\"\n> ]\n> ```\n> \n> but using `cp` tries to **overwrite the existing file** in _godot/bin/_ which is where the extension is configured.\n> \n> so I tried using an alternative that **doesn't overwrite** but instead **create** a new file.\n> \n> ```\n> [tasks.debug]\n> script = [\n>     \"cargo build\",\n>     \"mv target/debug/libLosSementales.so ../godot/bin/libLosSementales.so\"\n> ]\n> ```\n> \n> and so far so good :D\n\nThank you. This worked for me.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3963760873/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]